    <bpmn:process id="W_W3777" name="W3777. Campus, University &amp; Vocational School Partnership &amp; Early-Career Pipeline" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual campus cycle; partnership strategy
Frequency: Annual + continuous
Volume: Multi-school partnership portfolio
Owner: TA Marketing / Early-Career Lead
Participants: TA Marketing, Recruiting (links to VS-19.1), Store Ops (links to VS-07), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Apprenticeship (links to VS-123), DEI (links to VS-103.2), Marketing (links to VS-14)
Source: workflow W3777 — Campus, University &amp; Vocational School Partnership &amp; Early-Career Pipeline</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3777_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3777_Lane1" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3777_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3777_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3777_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3777_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3777_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3777_Start3" name="Annual campus cycle; partnership strategy">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3777_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3777_Task4" name="TA Marketing/Early-Career define the campus and school-partnership strategy…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/Early-Career define the campus and school-partnership strategy: target universities (business, supply chain, IT, engineering), technical/vocational schools and TESDA partners (for trade-knowledgeable frontline — links to VS-123), senior-high/shs-partner tracks, and regional schools near store/DC locations; map partnerships to BuildRight&#x27;s talent segments and growth regions
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Early-Career
Accountable (A): TA Lead / CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3777_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3777_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3777_Task5" name="TA Marketing execute campus engagement: career fairs, on-campus employer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing execute campus engagement: career fairs, on-campus employer branding, classroom/club sponsorships, BuildRight store/DC tours and immersion, case competitions, and internship/OJT placement (links to VS-19.1/W179 cadetship); capture leads into talent CRM (links to W3770) with consent
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Recruiting
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3777_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3777_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3777_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Analytics measure campus-pipeline yield (interns → conversions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing/Analytics measure campus-pipeline yield (interns → conversions, school ROI, early-career retention) and report to TA governance (links to W3784) and CHRO
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3777_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3777_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3777_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3777_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3777_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-594 (ensure controlled execution — Talent Community, Campus Pipeline &amp; TA Analytics (PA-121.3).) | - operational: school-ROI analytics; operational: CRM capture + nurture (links to W3770)
Owner: TA Marketing / Early-Career Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3777_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3777_Annotation8" targetRef="W3777_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
