    <bpmn:process id="W_W3778" name="W3778. Management Trainee / Cadetship Program Design &amp; Talent-Brand Integration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Program cycle; curriculum refresh
Frequency: Annual cohort
Volume: MT/cadet cohort per year
Owner: Early-Career Lead / L&amp;D
Participants: Early-Career, L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Recruiting (links to VS-19.1), Store Ops (links to VS-07), HR (links to VS-103), Compensation (links to VS-102), TA Marketing
Source: workflow W3778 — Management Trainee / Cadetship Program Design &amp; Talent-Brand Integration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3778_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3778_Lane1" name="Early-Career">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3778_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3778_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3778_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3778_Lane2" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3778_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3778_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3778_Start4" name="Program cycle; curriculum refresh">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3778_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3778_Task5" name="Early-Career/L&amp;D design the management-trainee/cadetship program (operational…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Early-Career/L&amp;D design the management-trainee/cadetship program (operational execution is W179 in VS-19.1 — this owns the *design, brand, and pipeline*): target segments (future store managers, merchants, supply-chain, digital), rotation curriculum, mentor/sponsor model, success criteria, and the talent-brand positioning that attracts top cadets
Responsible (R): Early-Career / L&amp;D
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3778_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3778_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3778_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Early-Career market the program: high-touch campus and CRM…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing/Early-Career market the program: high-touch campus and CRM campaign (links to W3777/W3770), selective assessment (links to W3772), compelling offer (links to VS-102/W3773), and a visible &quot;cadet → leader&quot; alumni story
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Early-Career
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Annual cohort</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3778_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3778_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3778_Task7" name="Early-Career/Analytics track cohort performance (completion, placement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Early-Career/Analytics track cohort performance (completion, placement, retention, promotion velocity) and feed insights to program design and to workforce planning (links to W3784/VS-103.3)
Responsible (R): Early-Career / Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3778_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3778_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3778_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3778_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3778_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-594 (ensure controlled execution — Talent Community, Campus Pipeline &amp; TA Analytics (PA-121.3).) | - operational: differentiated brand and EVP; operational: sponsor/mentor model and placement governance
Owner: Early-Career Lead / L&amp;D</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
