    <bpmn:process id="W_W3779" name="W3779. Internal Mobility Marketing, Talent Marketplace &amp; Career Pathing Communication" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Mobility strategy; internal posting cycle
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Enterprise internal-talent marketplace
Owner: TA Marketing / HR / EX
Participants: TA Marketing, HR (links to VS-19.1/W682), EX (links to VS-103.2), L&amp;D (links to VS-19.4), Store Ops (links to VS-07), Comms (links to VS-14.3)
Source: workflow W3779 — Internal Mobility Marketing, Talent Marketplace &amp; Career Pathing Communication</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3779_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3779_Lane1" name="TA Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3779_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3779_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3779_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3779_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3779_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3779_Start3" name="Mobility strategy; internal posting cycle">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3779_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3779_Task4" name="TA Marketing/EX/HR build the internal mobility marketing and talent…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/EX/HR build the internal mobility marketing and talent marketplace: visible internal career paths (cashier → supervisor → store manager; stock associate → DC lead; store → HQ), an internal job marketplace/gig platform, and proactive communication of open internal roles (the transactional posting workflow is W682 in VS-19.1 — this owns the *marketing and marketplace experience*)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / EX / HR
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3779_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3779_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3779_Task5" name="TA Marketing/L&amp;D communicate career-pathing, reskilling, and growth stories to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Marketing/L&amp;D communicate career-pathing, reskilling, and growth stories to existing employees (links to W3766 advocacy), enabling cross-entity/cross-region moves (links to W511) and reducing regrettable attrition
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / L&amp;D / EX
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3779_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3779_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3779_Task6" name="TA Marketing/Analytics measure internal-mobility health (internal-fill rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Marketing/Analytics measure internal-mobility health (internal-fill rate, mobility velocity, equity of access across entities/regions/gender) and report to CHRO and DEI governance (links to VS-103.2/W3784)
Responsible (R): TA Marketing / Analytics
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3779_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3779_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3779_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3779_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
