        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-594 (ensure controlled execution — Talent Community, Campus Pipeline &amp; TA Analytics (PA-121.3).) | - operational: marketplace and communication; operational: equity measurement
Owner: TA Marketing / HR / EX</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
