    <bpmn:process id="W_W3780" name="W3780. Alumni, Boomerang &amp; Former-Employee Re-engagement Program" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Separation (links to VS-19.5); re-engagement campaign
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: Alumni network (~1,000–1,340 exits/yr)
Owner: TA Operations / EX
Participants: TA Operations, EX (links to VS-103.2), HR (links to VS-19.5), TA Marketing, Data Privacy (links to VS-91), Analytics (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3780 — Alumni, Boomerang &amp; Former-Employee Re-engagement Program</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3780_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3780_Lane1" name="TA Operations">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3780_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3780_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3780_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3780_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3780_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3780_Start3" name="Separation (links to VS-19.5); re-engagement campaign">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3780_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3780_Task4" name="TA Operations/EX stand up the alumni/boomerang program: at separation (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Operations/EX stand up the alumni/boomerang program: at separation (links to VS-19.5), capture consented alumni contact and a positive offboarding (links to W3776), maintain an alumni record/talent-CRM segment (links to W3770) with RA 10173-compliant consent and retention (links to VS-91)
Responsible (R): TA Operations / EX / HR
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3780_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3780_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3780_Task5" name="TA Operations/TA Marketing run alumni engagement and boomerang recruiting…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Operations/TA Marketing run alumni engagement and boomerang recruiting: periodic BuildRight updates, alumni events, and proactive outreach to eligible former employees for fitting openings (boomerang hires have higher retention and lower ramp cost); validate rehire eligibility per policy
Responsible (R): TA Operations / TA Marketing / HR
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3780_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3780_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
