        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Marketing/HR design and refresh the referral program marketing and incentive structure (the reward *processing* is W715 in VS-19.1 — this owns the *marketing, design, and channel*): tiered incentives, role-priority bonuses for hard-to-fill segments, easy-share referral links and tracking, and equitable access across all 205 locations
