        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Operations/IT/EA manage the TA technology stack: ATS, talent CRM, career-site/CMS, assessment/scheduling, background-check, sourcing tools; integration to HRIS/payroll (links to VS-103.3/VS-19.2) and SSO/identity (links to VS-27.3), aligned to enterprise architecture (links to VS-113)
