Responsible (R): TA Operations / IT
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3782_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3782_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
