Owner: TA Lead / Compliance / Legal
Participants: TA Lead, Compliance (links to VS-22), Legal (links to VS-100.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), Data Privacy (links to VS-91), Audit (links to VS-21), DEI (links to VS-103.2)
