        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Lead/Compliance/Legal maintain TA compliance: equal-employment-opportunity policy, lawful job advertisements, lawful pre-hire checks (links to W3772), compliant offer/contract terms (links to VS-100.3/W688), anti-discrimination, and DOLE/labor-law alignment (links to VS-22/VS-84)
Responsible (R): TA Lead / Compliance / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO
