    <bpmn:process id="W_W3784" name="W3784. TA Analytics, Workforce-Planning Linkage &amp; Strategic Talent Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Planning cycle (links to VS-33.1); reporting cadence
Frequency: Monthly + quarterly + annual
Volume: Enterprise TA analytics &amp; workforce-planning linkage
Owner: TA Lead / Analytics
Participants: TA Lead, Analytics (links to VS-28.1), People Analytics (links to VS-103.3), HR (links to VS-19/VS-103), Finance (links to VS-17.4), Strategy (links to VS-33), CHRO
Source: workflow W3784 — TA Analytics, Workforce-Planning Linkage &amp; Strategic Talent Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3784_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3784_Lane1" name="TA Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3784_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3784_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3784_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3784_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3784_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3784_Start3" name="Planning cycle (links to VS-33.1); reporting cadence">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3784_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3784_Task4" name="TA Lead/Analytics maintain the TA analytics suite: funnel (links to W3776)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: TA Lead/Analytics maintain the TA analytics suite: funnel (links to W3776), source/channel ROI (links to W3763/W3768), employer-brand health (links to W3765), talent-community/CRM yield (links to W3770/W3780/W3781), diversity (links to W3767), quality-of-hire and early-attrition linkage (links to VS-103.3)
Responsible (R): TA Lead / Analytics
Accountable (A): TA Lead
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3784_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3784_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3784_Task5" name="TA Lead/People-Analytics link TA to strategic workforce planning (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: TA Lead/People-Analytics link TA to strategic workforce planning (links to VS-103.3): supply/demand by role/region/entity, build-vs-buy decisions, succession bench (links to W178), and store-opening/expansion staffing forecasts (links to VS-37/VS-33.1)
Responsible (R): TA Lead / People Analytics / Strategy
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual + quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3784_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3784_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3784_Task6" name="TA Lead/CHRO report strategic talent insights to the executive committee and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: TA Lead/CHRO report strategic talent insights to the executive committee and board talent/sustainability lens (links to VS-33.2/VS-36/VS-25.3), and translate into TA strategy, EVP, and budget actions (links to W3761/W3768)
Responsible (R): TA Lead / CHRO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly/annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3784_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3784_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3784_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3784_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3784_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-124 (ensure lawful &amp; consented candidate data handling.) | - operational: linkage and executive reporting; operational: supply/demand modeling
Owner: TA Lead / Analytics</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
